Name and logo
-------------

"VizMini2" and its logo identify the official app published by Juan Carlos Manzanares Serrano. The license covers
the code, not the name or the logo (section 6 of the Apache License grants no trademark rights): forks and modified
versions must use another name and another logo, and must not suggest that they are the official app.


